ad328</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC10320055</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">37125649</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Asnicar F., Thomas A. M., Beghini F., Mengoni C., Manara S., Manghi P., Zhu Q., Bolzan M., Cumbo F., May U., Sanders J. G., Zolfo M., Kopylova E., Pasolli E., Knight R., Mirarab S., Huttenhower C., Segata N.. Precise Phylogenetic Analysis of Microbial Isolates and Genomes from Metagenomes Using PhyloPhlAn 3.0. Nat. Commun. 2020;11(1):2500. doi: 10.1038/s41467-020-16366-7.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/s41467-020-16366-7</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC7237447</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">32427907</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Letunic I., Bork P.. Interactive Tree Of Life (iTOL) v5: An Online Tool for Phylogenetic Tree Display and Annotation. Nucleic Acids Res. 2021;49(W1):W293&#x2013;W296. doi: 10.1093/nar/gkab301.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1093/nar/gkab301</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC8265157</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">33885785</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Sahlin K.. Strobealign: Flexible Seed Size Enables Ultra-Fast and Accurate Read Alignment. Genome Biol. 2022;23(1):260. doi: 10.1186/s13059-022-02831-7.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1186/s13059-022-02831-7</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC9753264</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">36522758</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Anders S., Pyl P. T., Huber W.. HTSeq&#xe5f8;a Python Framework to Work with High-Throughput Sequencing Data. Bioinformatics. 2015;31(2):166&#x2013;169. doi: 10.1093/bioinformatics/btu638.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btu638</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4287950</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25260700</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Ricotta C., De Bello F., Moretti M., Caccianiga M., Cerabolini B. E. L., Pavoine S.. Measuring the Functional Redundancy of Biological Communities: A Quantitative Guide. Methods Ecol. Evol. 2016;7(11):1386&#x2013;1395. doi: 10.1111/2041-210X.12604.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1111/2041-210X.12604</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Bizzotto E., Fraulini S., Zampieri G., Orellana E., Treu L., Campanaro S.. MICROPHERRET MICRObial PHEnotypic tRait ClassifieR Using Machine lEarning Techniques. Environ. Microbiome. 2024;19(1):58. doi: 10.1186/s40793-024-00600-6.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1186/s40793-024-00600-6</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC11308548</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">39113074</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Rajagopal R., Mass&#xe9; D. I., Singh G.. A Critical Review on Inhibition of Anaerobic Digestion Process by Excess Ammonia. Bioresour. Technol. 2013;143:632&#x2013;641. doi: 10.1016/j.biortech.2013.06.030.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.biortech.2013.06.030</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23835276</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Liu F., Zhang Y., Zhang Y., Yang J., Shen W., Yang S., Quan Z., Liu B., Yuan Z., Zhang Y.. Thermodynamic Restrictions Determine Ammonia Tolerance of Functional Floras during Anaerobic Digestion. Bioresour. Technol. 2024;391:129919. doi: 10.1016/j.biortech.2023.129919.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.biortech.2023.129919</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">37884096</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Rocamora I., Wagland S. T., Hassard F., Villa R., Peces M., Simpson E. W., Fern&#xe1;ndez O., Baj&#xf3;n-Fern&#xe1;ndez Y.. Inhibitory Mechanisms on Dry Anaerobic Digestion: Ammonia, Hydrogen and Propionic Acid Relationship. Waste Manage. 2023;161:29&#x2013;42. doi: 10.1016/j.wasman.2023.02.009.</Citation><ArticleIdList><Arti